window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>It was supposed to be a one-night stand. But fate had a different plan for them.</p> <p>Sheriff Tyler Beaumont knew three things when he first saw Veronica Carter. Despite her Multiple Sclerosis, he’d never seen a more enchanting woman. He’d sacrifice his very soul to win her heart. And the self-proclaimed chaos witch brought nothing but trouble.</p> <p>Veronica never meant to stay in Crestmont. Putting down roots makes her an easy target. She lives in constant fear that her past will catch up with her. But something about Tyler has hope blooming in the ashes of her heart. Can she trust the upright officer of the law with her secrets? Veronica looks for a sign from the universe to guide her path.</p> <p>As signs go, a witch can’t argue with a positive pregnancy test.</p> <p>Chaos Witch Wedding is the second book in the Coven of Crestmont paranormal women’s fiction series. If you enjoy riveting tales of love, mystery, and books featuring characters over forty, you don’t want to miss USA Today Bestselling author Jennifer L. Hart’s spellbinding tale. Download Chaos Witch Wedding and embrace the chaos today!</p>"; 
